1
00:00:00,894 --> 00:00:02,724
(Leonard:)In our lives?

2
00:00:03,864 --> 00:00:06,334
That-That we're living?

3
00:00:06,333 --> 00:00:09,003
(Sheldon:)Oh, yes. I...

4
00:00:09,002 --> 00:00:12,072
(Sheldon:)Just yesterday, you had
a-a big piece of lettuce

5
00:00:12,072 --> 00:00:13,672
(Sheldon:)stuck in your teeth at lunch.

6
00:00:13,674 --> 00:00:17,244
(Sheldon:)Did I say anything? No.

7
00:00:18,345 --> 00:00:20,015
(Sheldon:)I compromised

8
00:00:20,013 --> 00:00:22,413
(Sheldon:)and kept my mouth shut.

9
00:00:22,416 --> 00:00:26,186
(Sheldon:)Like you should've, because
everyone was laughing at you.

10
00:00:26,186 --> 00:00:29,186
(Leonard:)That is not
a compromise.

11
00:00:29,189 --> 00:00:31,189
(Leonard:)A compromise is me
driving you everywhere

12
00:00:31,191 --> 00:00:32,861
(Leonard:)because you refuse to learn how.

13
00:00:32,859 --> 00:00:35,029
(Sheldon:)Oh, I learned how.
Amy taught me.

14
00:00:35,028 --> 00:00:37,028
What? Then-Then why
don't you do it?

15
00:00:37,030 --> 00:00:40,270
(Sheldon:)Uh, well, it's scary.

16
00:00:40,267 --> 00:00:44,267
(Sheldon:)And sometimes
I get the pedals mixed up.

17
00:00:45,372 --> 00:00:48,202
(Sheldon:)But, more importantly,
driving me to work

18
00:00:48,208 --> 00:00:51,108
(Sheldon:)is one of the things
that gives your life purpose.

19
00:00:53,046 --> 00:00:54,616
(Sheldon:)I can't take that away from you,

20
00:00:54,615 --> 00:00:59,025
(Sheldon:)so... what do I do?

